  "accountLegalTermsHeading": "Terms of use",
  "@accountLegalTermsHeading": {
    "description": "C28 heading"
  },
  "accountLegalTermsBody": "PAO connects you with independent, verified service providers. Prices are fixed and shown before you book; extra work needs your approval in the app. You pay the provider in cash when the job is done. Please be at the address on time, treat providers with respect and cancel early if your plans change. Accounts that misuse PAO may be suspended.",
